		{
			dependencies: [
				"79CA283CB3EAD8A8"
				"10B4D789801FA7A3"
			]
			description: [
				"核能熔炉可以使用八个核能熔炉组件建造。&r（The Nuclear Furnace can be contructed with eight nuclear Furnace Components.&r）"
				""
				"使用铀棒作为燃料时，它可以进行以下转化：&r（If it is fueled with Uranium Rods it can turn:&r）"
				""
				"&lo&r 空白矢量算子 → 核能矢量算子&r（&lo&r Empty Vector Operators into Nuclear Vector Operators&r）"
				""
				"&lo&r 空弹壳 → 裂变核心&r（&lo&r Empty Shells into Fissile Cores&r）"
				""
				"在加工过程中，核能熔炉会积累核废料。&r（In this process the nuclear furnace will accumulate nuclear waste.&r）"
				"提供金属桶可以将核废料取出。&r（You can remove this by providing it with Metal Barrels.&r）"
				""
				"&l如果内部废料储槽达到容量上限，核能熔炉就会发生核熔毁，摧毁自身及周围的一切。&r&r（&lIf you let the internal waste resevour fill up to the maximum limit the furnace will destroy itself and everything around it in a nuclear meltdown.&r&r）"
			]
