		{
			dependencies: ["724BF4D8D1DA930D"]
			description: [
				"你需要拆除核弹，才能获得内部的裂变核心。&r（You will need to difuse a nuclear bomb to obtain the Fission Core within.&r）"
				""
				"首先使用撬棍撬开核弹顶部。&r（First use a Crowbar to pry the top off of the bomb.&r）"
				""
				"然后使用钢丝钳剪断其中一根导线。&r（Then use Wire Cutters to cut one of the wires.&r）"
				"左键点击会剪断红色导线。&r（Left-clicking will cut the red wire.&r）"
				"右键点击会剪断绿色导线。&r（Right-clicking will cut the green wire.&r）"
				""
				"其中一根导线会解除核弹，另一根会使装置在 10 秒后爆炸。&r（One wire will difuse the bomb; the other will rig the device to explode within 10 seconds.&r）"
