		{
			dependencies: ["1F81CCC1F7562C57"]
			description: [
				"&l跨维度收发器是建立跨维度自动化设施的关键方块。&r&r（&lThe Interdimensional Transceiver is a crucial block when it comes to setting up interdimensional automation.&r&r）"
				""
				"&l步骤 1&r&r（&lStep 1&r&r）"
				"首先将收发器放在主基地内，连接到有电力供应的 ME 系统，然后点击 Mode（模式），将其设为发送端。&r（Start by placing the first Transceiver inside your main base; make sure it's hooked up to a powered ME System and click on \"Mode\" to make it a sender.&r）"
				""
				"{image:kubejs:textures/questbook/book_images/transceiver_step1.png width:84 height:67 align:center}"
				""
				"&l步骤 2&r&r（&lStep 2&r&r）"
				"点击 Add（添加），创建一个任意名称的频道，然后在列表中点击该频道进行选择。&r（Next, make a new channel by clicking \"Add\" and give it any name. Click on it in the list to select it.&r）"
				""
				"{image:kubejs:textures/questbook/book_images/transceiver_step2.png width:84 height:67 align:center}"
				""
				"&l步骤 3&r&r（&lStep 3&r&r）"
				"发送端设置完成后，可以在任意位置放置任意数量的收发器，在频道列表中选择刚创建的频道，即可全部连接到同一个发送端。&r（Now that the sender is set up, you can place an infinite number of Transceivers anywhere and hook them all up to the same sending Transceiver by clicking the channel you made in the list.&r）"
			]
